{
  "summary": "This experiment tested the scgpt RNA encoder in a singleprofile setup without image input or aggregation, establishing a baseline for its performance in this context. Validation accuracy (0.4106) and F1 (0.3785) are lower than the singleprofile pca_n2000 baseline (llm_summary_001), suggesting scgpt may underperform in singleprofile compared to other encoders. The exact impact of encoder choice on singleprofile performance remains uncertain without direct comparisons to alternative encoders or experimental controls."
}

